      <transcript>CICIRE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= cecere-] v.i To tremble, shake, shiver, quake; quiver.</definition>
      <page>176</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠠᠶᠤᠵᠢ ᠴᠢᠴᠢᠷᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>ajuzu –ky</transcript>
          <definition>To tremble with fear.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠳᠠᠭᠠᠷᠠᠵᠤ ᠴᠢᠴᠢᠷᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>daγarazu - -ky,</transcript>
          <definition>To tremble with cold</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠢᠷᠦᠭᠡ ᠴᠢᠴᠢᠷᠠᠮᠦᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>ziryke --myi</transcript>
          <definition>The- heart throbs.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
